    [P0] Document measuring and let measure.sh grade apps in other checkouts
    
    - rewrite-evidence/README.md: one-time setup, how to run measure.sh and the
      E2E suite, what each metrics.csv column means, and how to keep the
      yardstick away from a workflow (branch before it, --no-local single-branch
      clone, since git rm and worktrees still expose it through git history).
    - measure.sh --app now also takes a path to an app in another checkout;
      branch/commit/dirty are read from that checkout.
    
